  "source_video": null,
  "style_guide": "Kyoto mountain-town autumn campus aesthetic. Palette: charred timber (#2d2a28), maple red (#8f262a), amber glow (#e09b3d), moss green (#6d7c50), patina teal (#608b8c), and burnt copper (#b66033). Architecture features dark shou-sugi-ban timber walls, slate-tiled pitched roofs, copper/patina trim, and warm glowing shoji-style windows. Wet flagstone walkways, misty dusk atmosphere, mossy stone lanterns, and crimson/copper autumn foliage surround the central pond and southern river.",
